The current secrets.yaml contains the old MediaWiki secret (MYSQL_* keys + MW secret/upgrade keys).
It must be replaced with a new SOPS-encrypted secret for CNPG.

To create the new secrets.yaml:

1. Enter the Nix dev shell: nix develop (or direnv allow)
2. Generate a password:
   PW=$(tr -dc 'A-Za-z0-9' </dev/urandom | head -c 32)
3. Create and encrypt:
   cat > /tmp/pappwiki-db-secret.yaml << EOF
   apiVersion: v1
   kind: Secret
   metadata:
     name: pappwiki-db-secret
     namespace: pappwiki
   type: kubernetes.io/basic-auth
   stringData:
     username: pappwiki
     password: "$PW"
   EOF
   sops --encrypt /tmp/pappwiki-db-secret.yaml > k8s/apps/pappwiki/secrets.yaml
   rm /tmp/pappwiki-db-secret.yaml
4. Delete this README and the .plaintext-DONOTCOMMIT file before committing.
